'''Cadaver Bear''' (クマンケン, ''Kumanken'') is a [[:Category:Zombie Enemies|Zombie]] variant of [[Teacher Bear]] that appears in [[Into the Future]]'s [[Zombie Outbreaks]], [[The Aku Realms]] and [[Legend Stages]]. It was added in [[Version 7.4 Update|Version 7.4]].

