==Trivia==
*Cadaver Bear is based on the stereotypical depiction of [[wikipedia:Frankenstein's monster|Frankenstein's Monster]], an unnamed entity forged from dissected corpse fragments whose most popular appearance has bolts in his ears.
*Cadaver Bear's Japanese name, Kumanken (クマンケン), is derived from 熊 ''kuma'' (bear), ''Fr'''anken'''stein'' and possibly 拳 ''ken'' (fist), as [[Teacher Bear]]'s description mentions their fists.
*As stated in its Japanese description, Cadaver Bear's head has a slightly different shape compared to other [[Teacher Bear]] variants.
*On frame 5 of its burrow animation, Cadaver Bear's legs disconnect from its body.

